---
import ExperimentHistory from '../../components/ExperimentHistory.astro';
import '@fontsource-variable/noto-sans-sc';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css';
import '../../styles/buoyancy-lab.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content="旋转观察三维浮力实验，调整浸入深度，理解排水体积、浮力与测力计读数。" />
    <title>浮力实验台 · 科学探索实验室</title>
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#experiment">跳到实验</a>
    <header class="lab-header">
      <a href="/" class="brand"><span class="brand-symbol">∴</span> 科学探索实验室 <small>STEM LAB</small></a>
      <a class="back" href="/">返回探索首页 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <section class="intro">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">初中物理 / 阿基米德原理</p><h1>水托住的，<br class="mobile-break" />究竟有多重？</h1><p class="intro-copy">把铝块慢慢放进水中。看排水体积如何改变浮力，又如何改变测力计的读数。</p></div>
        <div class="experiment-stamp"><span>EXPERIMENT</span><strong>F<span>浮</span> = ρgV<span>排</span></strong><span>观察 → 建模 → 推导</span></div>
      </section>
      <ExperimentHistory slug="buoyancy" />
      <section id="experiment" class="experiment-grid" aria-label="浮力交互实验">
        <div class="scene-panel">
          <div class="scene-heading"><span><i></i> 三维实验台</span><span class="scene-tag" id="phase">部分浸入</span></div>
          <div class="viewport" id="lab-viewport" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="三维实验装置。拖动旋转，滚轮缩放，方向键调整视角。">
            <div id="scene-fallback" class="scene-fallback">
              <svg id="buoyancy-2d" viewBox="0 0 440 360" role="img" aria-label="铝块悬挂于水槽内的浮力实验示意">
                <path d="M85 310H365M120 310V35H250V90" fill="none" stroke="#62768a" stroke-width="9" />
                <rect x="229" y="90" width="42" height="72" rx="9" fill="#edf4fa" stroke="#18334c" stroke-width="3" />
                <path d="M250 162V207" stroke="#18334c" stroke-width="3" />
                <path d="M150 190V310H350V190" fill="#e0f1fc" stroke="#167db5" stroke-width="3" />
                <path d="M150 243H350V310H150Z" fill="#91cce9" opacity=".6" />
                <rect id="buoyancy-2d-block" x="225" y="218" width="50" height="50" fill="#a2aeb9" stroke="#18334c" stroke-width="2" />
                <text x="295" y="235" fill="#18334c" font-size="15">铝块</text><text x="180" y="292" fill="#167db5" font-size="15">液体</text>
              </svg>
              <p id="scene-message">正在准备三维装置…</p>
            </div>
            <div class="instrument-readout" aria-label="测力计读数"><span>测力计</span><strong><span data-reading="tensionN">22.0</span><small> N</small></strong></div>
            <div class="scene-hint" id="scene-hint">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 方向键调整</div>
          </div>
          <div class="scene-toolbar"><div class="legend"><span><i class="water-key"></i>浮力 F浮</span><span><i class="weight-key"></i>重力 G</span><span><i class="tension-key"></i>拉力 T</span></div><button id="camera-reset" type="button">恢复视角 ↺</button></div>
        </div>
        <aside class="controls-panel" aria-label="实验控制">
          <p class="eyebrow">改变一个条件，观察一个关系</p><h2>动手试一试</h2>
          <p class="first-action">先做一件事：保持液体不变，只拖动浸入深度，看排水体积怎样改变。也可随时自由探索。</p><label class="control-label" for="immersion">浸入深度 <output id="depth-value" for="immersion">5.0 cm</output></label>
          <input id="immersion" type="range" min="0" max="10" step="0.1" value="5" />
          <div class="range-labels"><span>刚接触液面</span><span>完全浸没</span></div><div class="displaced-preview"><div aria-hidden="true"><i id="immersed-fill"></i></div><p id="displaced-link">浸入部分排开同体积液体。</p></div><p id="buoyancy-task-note" role="status">先自己改变浸入量，留下观察证据。</p><p class="control-note">滑块控制0–10 cm浸入长度；当前不能操作完全浸没后继续下沉。“更深但浮力不变”是模型推论，尚不是这里的操作证据。g=10 m/s²。</p>
          <p class="control-note">从当前液面到铝块底面的距离。</p>
          <label class="control-label liquid-label" for="liquid">液体密度</label>
          <select id="liquid"><option value="1000">水 · 1000 kg/m³</option><option value="800">低密度液体 · 800 kg/m³</option><option value="1200">高密度液体 · 1200 kg/m³</option></select>
          <div class="control-actions"><button class="primary" id="play" aria-pressed="false" type="button">播放入水过程</button><button id="reset" type="button">重置</button></div>
          <p class="motion-note" id="motion-note" hidden>你已设置减少动态效果；仍可手动播放或调整深度。</p>
          <dl class="readings">
            <div><dt>排水体积 V排</dt><dd><span data-reading="displacedCm3">500</span><small> cm³</small></dd></div>
            <div class="highlight-reading"><dt>浮力 F浮</dt><dd><span data-reading="buoyancyN">5.0</span><small> N</small></dd></div>
            <div><dt>液面升高 Δh</dt><dd><span data-reading="riseCm">1.25</span><small> cm</small></dd></div>
            <div><dt>底部液体压强 p</dt><dd><span data-reading="bottomPressurePa">1625</span><small> Pa</small></dd></div>
          </dl>
          <p class="balance">受力平衡 <strong>T + F浮 = G = 27 N</strong></p>
        </aside>
      </section>
      <section class="lesson" aria-labelledby="lesson-heading">
        <div class="lesson-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">把现象变成解题思路</p><h2 id="lesson-heading">沿着三个状态理解浮力</h2></div><p>点击状态，让实验停在关键位置。</p></div>
        <div class="lesson-steps" role="group" aria-label="实验关键状态">
          <button data-stage="0" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="step-number">01 / 刚接触</span><strong>没有排水，就没有浮力</strong><span>V排 = 0，测力计承担全部重力。</span></button>
          <button data-stage="5" type="button" aria-pressed="true"><span class="step-number">02 / 部分浸入</span><strong>浸得越深，读数越小</strong><span>排水体积增加，液体分担更多重力。</span></button>
          <button data-stage="10" type="button" aria-pressed="false"><span class="step-number">03 / 完全浸没</span><strong>此时，排水体积等于物体体积</strong><span>模型推论：完全浸没后浮力不随深度增大；当前装置不能继续下沉验证。</span></button>
        </div>
        <div class="derivation" aria-live="polite" id="derivation">水中浸入 5.0 cm：V排 = 100 × 5.0 = 500 cm³；F浮 = 1000 × 10 × 0.000500 = 5.0 N；T = 27 − 5.0 = 22.0 N。</div>
      </section>
      <section class="lab-notes"><div><h3>实验条件</h3><p>铝块边长 10 cm，密度 2700 kg/m³；容器底面积 400 cm²，初始液深 15 cm；取 g = 10 N/kg。</p></div><div><h3>模型说明</h3><p>缓慢升降，忽略空气浮力、液体阻力与绳子体积；物体不触底、不自由漂浮。箭头长度表示力的相对大小，测力计为准静态读数示意。</p></div></section>
    </main>
    <footer><span>科学探索实验室 · 浮力实验台 · <a href="/stem-lab/pendulum/">探索单摆与能量 ↗</a></span><span>装置呈现与共享模型思路参考 <a href="https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Anatomy ↗</a> · 三维渲染 <a href="https://threejs.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Three.js ↗</a></span></footer>
    <script>import '../../scripts/stem-lab/buoyancy';</script>
  </body>
</html>
